{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v0bnh9s","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":30,"title":"Tageszeiten","nativeTitle":"Times of Day","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Lisa","Emma","Nico"],"speakerGenders":{"Lisa":"female","Emma":"female","Nico":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Emma steht um halb sieben auf . Danach putzt sie Zähne . Das ist wichtig , Emma, okay?","native":"Emma gets up at half past six. After that she brushes her teeth. That's important, Emma, okay?"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Ich putze immer meine Zähne!","native":"I always brush my teeth!"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Immer oder manchmal ?","native":"Always or sometimes?"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Fast immer .","native":"Almost always."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Okay … Zum Frühstück isst Emma normalerweise Müsli mit Milch. Aber manchmal isst sie auch einen Apfel . Und zum Mittagessen gibt es oft Gemüse .","native":"Okay … For breakfast Emma usually eats muesli with milk. But sometimes she also eats an apple. And for lunch there are often vegetables."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Gemüse?","native":"Vegetables?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, Gemüse ... Tomaten, Salat, Brokkoli. Mittagessen gibt es um zwölf. Von zwei bis drei Uhr macht Emma normalerweise Hausaufgaben. Und von vier bis halb fünf übt sie Flöte . Ich kontrolliere das!","native":"Yes, vegetables ... tomatoes, salad, broccoli. Lunch is at twelve. From two to three o'clock Emma usually does her homework. And from four to half past four she practices the flute. I'll check on that!"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Ja, ja …","native":"Yeah, yeah …"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Und du siehst nicht fern . Und nach dem Spielen räumst du auf . Ich möchte hier kein Chaos haben!","native":"And you don't watch TV. And after playing you tidy up. I don't want any chaos here!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Kein Problem.","native":"No problem."},{"